  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Development Enterprises (IDE) - Livelihoods Protection and Promotion Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the IDE component is to increase the production and income levels of 20 smallholder farmer market garden groups through creation of Output Markets for Defined Crops

There are two anticipated results (outputs) as follows:
&#x2022; Increased market garden higher value crop production for approximately 2,000 households
&#x2022; Increased household income from agricultural products for 2000 hh</narrative>
  </description>
